      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-039",
        "start": 121.44,
        "end": 123.283,
        "text": "绝对是能反映这个品牌的特性的",
        "representativeTime": 122.362,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-039.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-040",
        "start": 123.283,
        "end": 125.521,
        "text": "那么字节跳动的就是激发创造丰富生活",
        "representativeTime": 124.402,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-040.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-041",
        "start": 125.521,
        "end": 127.101,
        "text": "没有人能真正拥有百达翡丽",
        "representativeTime": 126.311,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013",
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 127.101,
        "end": 130.789,
        "text": "你只在替下一代保管它，让人类成为多形性物种space x",
        "representativeTime": 128.945,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 130.8,
        "end": 132.266,
        "text": "为中国人做一篇汽车玻璃",
        "representativeTime": 131.533,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014",
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 132.266,
        "end": 133.599,
        "text": "扶摇科技基本上不赚钱",
        "representativeTime": 132.933,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 133.599,
        "end": 138,
        "text": "交个朋友爱奇赚了一堆钱，把债全还完了，还有就是爱在胖东来，多快好省",
        "representativeTime": 135.799,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015",
          "SHOT-016"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 138.01,
        "end": 141.804,
        "text": "胖东来和京东，那么这期就说到这里，我是人类最上边的，我们下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 139.907,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-016"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
